---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Our Purpose — Base Impact" description="Base Impact's mission: technology help for Brevard County — devices, internet, and the skills to use them.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Our Purpose</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    <p>Base Impact exists to help neighbors get connected and help small local nonprofits keep their technology working.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">What we believe</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Everyone deserves access</strong> — to a working device, internet service, and the skills to use them.</li>
      <li><strong>Small groups matter</strong> — Churches, pantries, and 1–5 person nonprofits are the backbone of community help. They deserve good tech support.</li>
      <li><strong>Local first</strong> — We focus on Brevard County because that's where we live and serve.</li>
      <li><strong>Simple is better</strong> — Our resource directory works alongside 211, not instead of it. We make things easier to find.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Our approach</h2>
    <p>Immediate needs first. Then the skills and tools that keep people housed, employed, and connected. We start with what's urgent and build from there.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
